# emulator_lib both pull it in; Cargo would unify features across a single
# build, so both must reference the *same* Bazel target or the two compiled
# instances would produce mismatched types at the trait boundaries where they
# meet -- see the cross-workspace-mix comment in caliptra-sw/BUILD.bazel).
